<p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467; margin-top: 18px">PasarMIKRO is preparing its first pilot with a licensed Indonesian insurer, inside a donor-supported inclusive insurance programme. It runs in six-month phases, so what works can be extended phase by phase.</p>
