<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 18px; margin-top: 36px"><div style="border: 1px solid #EAECF0; border-radius: 18px; padding: 26px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start"><div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: #ECF9FE; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#006386" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"></path></svg></div><div><h3 style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800">PasarMIKRO is not an insurer</h3><p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475467; margin-top: 6px">We provide the technology and field operations. Insurance products are provided and underwritten by licensed insurers registered with OJK.</p></div></div><div style="border: 1px solid #EAECF0; border-radius: 18px; padding: 26px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start"><div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: #ECF9FE; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#006386" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="5" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="5" cy="19" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="19" cy="19" r="2.5"></circle><path d="M12 7.5v4M12 11.5l-5.5 5.5M12 11.5l5.5 5.5"></path></svg></div><div><h3 style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800">Insurer-agnostic and non-exclusive</h3><p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475467; margin-top: 6px">The platform works with any licensed insurer. Each insurer sets its own products, policy terms, claim criteria and underwriting.</p></div></div><div style="border: 1px solid #EAECF0; border-radius: 18px; padding: 26px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start"><div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: #ECF9FE; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#006386" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="11" width="16" height="10" rx="2"></rect><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4"></path></svg></div><div><h3 style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800">Farmer data protected</h3><p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475467; margin-top: 6px">Farmers own their data, under Indonesia's Personal Data Protection Law. One insurer's coverage and claim data is never shared with another.</p></div></div></div>
