<!-- FAQ -->
<section id="faq" style="padding: 96px 0">
<div style="max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px">
<h2 style="font-size: 38px; line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.025em">Embedded insurance FAQ</h2>
<div style="margin-top: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column"><div style="border-top: 1px solid #EAECF0; padding: 22px 0"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Is PasarMIKRO an insurance company?</h3><p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467; margin-top: 8px">No. PasarMIKRO provides the digital platform and field operations. Insurance products are designed, underwritten and paid by licensed insurers registered with OJK.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid #EAECF0; padding: 22px 0"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Which insurers can use the platform?</h3><p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467; margin-top: 8px">Any licensed insurer. The platform is insurer-agnostic and non-exclusive; each insurer keeps its own products, terms and claim criteria.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid #EAECF0; padding: 22px 0"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Which crops and risks are covered?</h3><p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467; margin-top: 8px">The first pilot covers rice, with crop and climate insurance. Other commodities and products can follow, depending on the insurer and programme.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid #EAECF0; padding: 22px 0"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">How are claims verified?</h3><p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467; margin-top: 8px">Claims are submitted digitally and checked for deadlines and completeness. Verification uses agronomy data, farm devices from partners where available, or field checks, and the documented claim goes to the insurer for assessment.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid #EAECF0; padding: 22px 0"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">How do farmers receive payouts?</h3><p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467; margin-top: 8px">Approved payouts are channelled to the farmer's own account through PasarMIKRO, with reconciliation and payment reports for the insurer.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid #EAECF0; padding: 22px 0"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">How is farmer data protected?</h3><p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467; margin-top: 8px">Farmers own their data, under Indonesia's Personal Data Protection Law. Data-sharing protocols are agreed with each partner, and one insurer's data is never shared with another.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid #EAECF0; border-bottom: 1px solid #EAECF0; padding: 22px 0"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">How is the service priced?</h3><p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467; margin-top: 8px">Each service (onboarding, plot mapping, claims support, payout channelling and dashboards) is priced by volume and scope. Contact us for a proposal.</p></div></div>
